    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, but isn't that kind of a reductive way to look at it? if we're talking about \"fairness,\" doesn't fairness also mean inclusion and making sure everyone has the right to participate in the activities they identify with? it feels like you're just dismissing the whole point of gender identity as a factor in how people actually live their lives.",
